  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Jemen valst&#xf6;d 2012-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Yemen Election Support 2012-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A multi-donor basket fund administered by UNDP to support the         electoral cycle during Phase II of the democratic transition in       Yemen. Expected key results: 1. Enhanced proper planning and          administration of voter registration, the constitutional referendum,  and remaining elections, 2. Inclusive electoral legal reform          supported, and 3. Increased participation in the electoral process</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En multi-donor basked fund administrerad av UNDP med syfte att st&#xf6;dja valprocessen under fas II av den demokratiska transitionen i Jemen.   F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultat &#xe4;r: 1) St&#xe4;rkt planering av och genomf&#xf6;rd          v&#xe4;ljarregistrering, folkomr&#xf6;stning om konstitutionen, och &#xe5;terst&#xe5;ende val 2) Reformering av vallagarna p&#xe5; ett inkluderande s&#xe4;tt, 3) &#xd6;kat    deltagande av civila samh&#xe4;llet, politiska partier mm i valprocessen</narrative>
  </description>
